  "note": "Machine-readable snapshot of the curated public API. Generated from the installed package; tests/packaging/test_public_api.py asserts equality. GV-2C-b is a narrow internal TECHNICAL authority leaf: it issues, signs, registers, resolves, verifies and revokes UVI policy versions for the five merged policy families. It does not author policy content, does not judge whether policy content is good, and never approves its own policy \u2014 approval remains an external human/governance responsibility reaching the authority only through the injected ApprovalVerifier boundary, whose only shipped implementation is DenyAllApprovalVerifier. canonical_policy_body_digest supplies the content-digest rule the merged contracts deliberately left to the Policy Authority: a single-pass canonical digest with the one self-referential path metadata.content_digest removed from the payload (no fixed point, no sentinel). InMemoryPolicyRegistry is reference-grade, not production persistence, and exposes no floating 'latest' lookup. Ed25519 signing follows the repository's existing stdlib-only RFC 8032 authority convention without importing another authority's internals. Benchmark-value registration is deferred to a later milestone.",
